# 12. Verify ManifestWorks

OCM deploys add-on resources to the managed cluster through ManifestWorks.

Run on the hub:

```bash
kubectl get manifestwork \
  -n "${MANAGED_CLUSTER_NAME}" \
  --context "${CTX_HUB_CLUSTER}"
```

For example:

```text
